/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (       Skillup Bharat's Data Science course is a comprehensive training program designed to equip learners with the essential skills and knowledge to excel in the field of data science. The course covers everything from fundamental concepts in data handling, statistics, and exploratory data analysis \(EDA\) to advanced machine learning algorithms and big data technologies. Learners are introduced to popular programming tools and libraries such as Python, NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, and Scikit-Learn, making it easy for them to process, analyze, and visualize data.)
/E (       Skillup Bharat's Data Science course is a comprehensive training program designed to equip learners with the essential skills and knowledge to excel in the field of data science. The course covers everything from fundamental concepts in data handling, statistics, and exploratory data analysis \(EDA\) to advanced machine learning algorithms and big data technologies. Learners are introduced to popular programming tools and libraries such as Python, NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, and Scikit-Learn, making it easy for them to process, analyze, and visualize data.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (     The program emphasizes practical, hands-on learning by incorporating real-world datasets and projects into the curriculum. Participants will work on diverse projects including machine learning models, big data processing using tools like Hadoop and Spark, and even delve into deep learning and natural language processing \(NLP\) applications. Throughout the course, students gain exposure to industry use cases in areas like finance, healthcare, and retail, helping them understand how data science solutions are applied to solve real-world problems.)
/E (     The program emphasizes practical, hands-on learning by incorporating real-world datasets and projects into the curriculum. Participants will work on diverse projects including machine learning models, big data processing using tools like Hadoop and Spark, and even delve into deep learning and natural language processing \(NLP\) applications. Throughout the course, students gain exposure to industry use cases in areas like finance, healthcare, and retail, helping them understand how data science solutions are applied to solve real-world problems.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
